oast of Devil Reef.<\/h4>\n<p>However, no charges were pressed and no smugglers were ever located. While suspicions remain regarding the activity off of Innsmouth\u2019s coast, the town has settled into uneasy silence and obscurity, as if hidden from the world\u2014and even separated from the passage of time\u2014by the fog and spray from the sea that seem perpetually to blanket the town.<\/p>                <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-1\/2 px-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"simple-dual-image relative max-w-full xs:mt-16 md:mt-36 mx-auto\"\n                         style=\"width: 90%; max-width: 1200px;\">\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/dual-image\/backthumbnail.png\"\n                             alt=\"Background frame 1\"\n                             class=\"absolute z-20 object-cover object-center max-w-[60%] thumbnail_news\"\n                             style=\"transform: rotate(7deg); left: 40%; top: -25%;\">\n\n                                                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/03\/AHC53-58_29576_TheAbandonedLighthouse_ImadAwan_web.webp\"\n                                 alt=\"First featured image\"\n                                 class=\"absolute z-10 h-full w-full object-cover thumbnail_bg\"\/>\n                        \n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/wp-content\/themes\/asmodee-arkhamhorror\/assets\/img\/herobanner\/dual-image\/backthumbnail.png\"\n                             alt=\"Background frame 2\"\n                             class=\"relative z-50 object-cover object-center max-w-[60%] thumbnail_news2 mr-auto block\"\n                             style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\">\n\n                      